    "requested_residual": "full action-space signed control-target offset after local scale and formal safety clip, before actuator ctrlrange",
    "effective_residual_after_ctrlrange": "full action-space signed control-target offset remaining after the model's enabled actuator ctrlrange clamp; not realized qpos motion",
